# Stock Market Data Engineering Pipeline

An end-to-end data engineering project that builds a daily stock market data pipeline for Indian stock exchanges (NSE/BSE). It extracts historical stock data, validates it, stores it in PostgreSQL, and is being extended into an automated, cloud-based pipeline on AWS.

The project is developed incrementally, starting with a local environment and gradually moving towards cloud deployment.

> 🚧 **Status:** Work in progress. Phases 1–3 are complete, Phase 4 is in progress, and AWS deployment, automation, and dashboards are planned.

